      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Join the First Day of the 5-Day Bootcamp \u2014 100% FREE\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "html": "<h4 class=\"p1\">\ud83d\udccc What You\u2019ll Learn in This 5-Day Bootcamp:</h4><p data-start=\"381\" data-end=\"533\"><strong data-start=\"383\" data-end=\"398\">1.) Advertising</strong><br data-start=\"398\" data-end=\"401\" />Create powerful ads that convert on Facebook, IG, TikTok, Google &amp; more.<br data-start=\"473\" data-end=\"476\" />\u2013 Master Facebook ad audience targeting, Google keyword research, and more<br />\u2013 Targeting, budgeting, creatives, pixels, and platforms.</p><p data-start=\"535\" data-end=\"677\"><strong data-start=\"537\" data-end=\"550\">2.) Promotion</strong><br data-start=\"550\" data-end=\"553\" />Use deals, incentives, and events to spark buyer action.<br data-start=\"609\" data-end=\"612\" />\u2013 Learn the smart way to do discounts without hurting your brand.</p><p data-start=\"679\" data-end=\"812\"><strong>3.) Publicity</strong><br data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"697\" />Get FREE attention for your brand using proven PR tactics.<br data-start=\"755\" data-end=\"758\" />\u2013 Good vs bad publicity, media hacks, and positioning.</p><p data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"938\"><strong data-start=\"816\" data-end=\"836\">4.) Public Relations</strong><br data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"839\" />Shape a trustworthy brand.<br data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"868\" />\u2013 Master PR strategy, digital presence, partnerships &amp; crisis control.</p><p data-start=\"940\" data-end=\"1056\"><strong data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"951\">5.) Sales</strong><br data-start=\"951\" data-end=\"954\" />Master the art of closing deals.<br data-start=\"986\" data-end=\"989\" />\u2013 Sales funnel, customer journey, personas, and closing like a pro.</p>"
    },
