      "html": "<h4 data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1093\">\u00a0</h4><h4 data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1093\">\ud83c\udf93 What You Stand to Gain:</h4><p data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1166\"><strong data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1123\">1.) Live Interactive Class</strong><br data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1126\" />Ask questions and get real-time answers.</p><p data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1245\"><strong data-start=\"1170\" data-end=\"1201\">2.) 70+ Practical Video Lessons</strong><br data-start=\"1201\" data-end=\"1204\" />Watch, learn, and implement at your own pace.</p><p data-start=\"1247\" data-end=\"1317\"><strong data-start=\"1249\" data-end=\"1264\">3.) Assignments</strong><br data-start=\"1264\" data-end=\"1267\" />Test your knowledge and sharpen your skills daily.</p><p data-start=\"1319\" data-end=\"1404\"><span data-start=\"1321\" data-end=\"1347\"><strong>4.)</strong> </span><strong data-start=\"1321\" data-end=\"1347\">Support &amp; Growth Group</strong><br data-start=\"1347\" data-end=\"1350\" />Join a network of focused, skilled marketers like you.</p><p data-start=\"1319\" data-end=\"1404\">\u00a0</p>"
