      "html": "<h4 data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1093\">\u00a0</h4><h4 data-start=\"1063\" data-end=\"1093\">\ud83c\udf93 We Also Train Staff Members:</h4><p>We provide comprehensive staff training at a <b>special discounted rate</b> through two highly effective methods:</p><p data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1166\"><strong data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1123\">1.) Live Interactive Class<br /></strong></p><p>Your team can join our dynamic, real-time virtual sessions, allowing for interactive learning and immediate engagement from anywhere.</p><p data-start=\"1319\" data-end=\"1404\"><strong>2.) Physical Interactive Class<br /></strong></p><div id=\"chat-history\" class=\"chat-history-scroll-container\"><div id=\"b66c404509a3472e\" class=\"conversation-container message-actions-hover-boundary ng-star-inserted\"><div><div class=\"response-container ng-tns-c2787428652-36 response-container-with-gpi ng-star-inserted response-container-has-multiple-responses\"><div class=\"presented-response-container ng-tns-c2787428652-36\"><div class=\"response-container-content ng-tns-c2787428652-36 has-thoughts\"><div class=\"response-content ng-tns-c2787428652-36\"><div id=\"model-response-message-contentr_b66c404509a3472e\" class=\"markdown markdown-main-panel stronger enable-updated-hr-color\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>For a hands-on experience, your staff can participate in our engaging in-person classes, fostering direct collaboration and practical skill development.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>"
